  "contract": "Application object reads, workflow mutations, AI candidate context, similarity, email context and provider handoff plus current membership/seat-scoped job, roster, hiring-manager, financial-document, organization-activity, routine-admin, talent-pool, organization privilege and versioned invitation commands are fail-closed; protected authorization and mutations share statement-bound grants; organization member privilege changes and password changes advance the affected account authorization version atomically; organization invitation bearers are strict, hashed at rest and ordinary registration never treats possession as mailbox proof; hiring-manager directory eligibility binds the stored organization to the exact accepted user; legacy numeric sessions are version-1 compatible and new sessions carry only id plus authVersion; provider/file work follows exact authorization; resume locator proxies, client-side download tracking, the routine admin application collection, consultant product and unsafe current-membership organization-attribution repair surfaces are retired. Historical ownership remains unknown and no replacement attribution is inferred. Seat-capacity serialization, password-reset token clearing, organization provisioning after the owner grant, accepted-history re-entry, invitation delivery truth and talent-pool conversion/suggestions remain outside this closure.",
